---
title: "transferInvestorPosition (LegionFixedPriceSale)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_auth: check caller is Legion operator
    q_check_auth --> q_revert_auth: caller not authorized
    q_revert_auth --> [*]: revert Unauthorized
    q_check_auth --> q_check_from: caller authorized
    q_check_from --> q_revert_no_pos: fromInvestor has no position
    q_revert_no_pos --> [*]: revert NoPosition
    q_check_from --> q_check_to: fromInvestor has position
    q_check_to --> q_revert_exists: toInvestor already has position
    q_revert_exists --> [*]: revert PositionAlreadyExists
    q_check_to --> q_transfer_pos: toInvestor has no position
    q_transfer_pos --> q_clear_old: positions[toInvestor] = positions[fromInvestor]
    q_clear_old --> [*]: delete positions[fromInvestor], emit PositionTransferred

    note right of q_transfer_pos
        INV-001: position transfer is atomic (copy then delete)
        INV-002: target address must not have existing position
        INV-003: all position fields transferred including vesting address
    end note
